# Frontend configuration. Copy to .env.local for local development.
#
# Only PUBLIC values belong here. Anything prefixed VITE_ is bundled into the
# browser app and visible to everyone.
#
# NEVER put these in any VITE_ variable, .env file, or Vercel browser setting:
#   Supabase secret or service_role key (sb_secret_..., service_role JWT)
#   Stripe secret or restricted keys (sk_..., rk_...) and webhook secrets (whsec_...)
#   Mux token secret and signing key
#   Email provider API keys
# Those live only in Supabase Edge Function secrets. `npm run check:secrets`
# fails the build if one appears in the bundle.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
VITE_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
